    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a Neon Puzzle Wonderland!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying journey through a vibrant, neon-infused world filled with mind-bending puzzles and exhilarating platform challenges! Whether you're a solo adventurer or love teaming up with friends, this game delivers a unique blend of creativity, strategy, and heart-pounding gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>275 Singleplayer Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a massive collection of handcrafted levels that will push your skills to the limit. Each level introduces new mechanics, requiring you to think outside the box and conquer increasingly challenging puzzles. Are you up for the ultimate test of strategy and precision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>40 Multiplayer Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and take on the challenge together! These multiplayer-exclusive levels are designed to test not just your platforming abilities, but also your teamwork and communication. Can you both make it to the portal in one piece?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>100+ Exciting PvP Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the competitive side of the game with over 100 unique PvP levels designed to challenge your skills and strategy. Each level offers distinct maps, mechanics, and obstacles to keep the gameplay fresh and engaging. Prove your dominance, adapt your tactics, and rise to the top in this thrilling multiplayer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtracks &amp; Stunning Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a neon dream with immersive soundtracks and stunningly designed assets. Every beat and visual cue enhances your gameplay experience, pulling you deeper into this mesmerizing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Hidden Treasure Hunt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game\u2019s mysterious corners and uncover hidden treasures! A thrilling treasure hunt awaits, taking you beyond the levels and into a world of secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Easter Eggs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled for pop culture references and hidden gems scattered throughout the game. Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a puzzle platformer\u2014it\u2019s an adventure packed with surprises, challenges, and unforgettable moments. Whether you're aiming to master the mechanics, discover every secret, or simply enjoy the neon vibes, there's something here for every gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take on the neon challenge? Add the game to your wishlist now and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.poster.avif?t=1744303815\" width=600 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.webm?t=1744303815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.mp4?t=1744303815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dive into a Neon Puzzle Wonderland!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an electrifying journey through a vibrant, neon-infused world filled with mind-bending puzzles and exhilarating platform challenges! Whether you're a solo adventurer or love teaming up with friends, this game delivers a unique blend of creativity, strategy, and heart-pounding gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf1f Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>275 Singleplayer Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a massive collection of handcrafted levels that will push your skills to the limit. Each level introduces new mechanics, requiring you to think outside the box and conquer increasingly challenging puzzles. Are you up for the ultimate test of strategy and precision?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd1d <strong>40 Multiplayer Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a friend and take on the challenge together! These multiplayer-exclusive levels are designed to test not just your platforming abilities, but also your teamwork and communication. Can you both make it to the portal in one piece?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>100+ Exciting PvP Levels</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into the competitive side of the game with over 100 unique PvP levels designed to challenge your skills and strategy. Each level offers distinct maps, mechanics, and obstacles to keep the gameplay fresh and engaging. Prove your dominance, adapt your tactics, and rise to the top in this thrilling multiplayer experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtracks &amp; Stunning Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lose yourself in a neon dream with immersive soundtracks and stunningly designed assets. Every beat and visual cue enhances your gameplay experience, pulling you deeper into this mesmerizing world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Hidden Treasure Hunt</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the game\u2019s mysterious corners and uncover hidden treasures! A thrilling treasure hunt awaits, taking you beyond the levels and into a world of secrets and surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc23 <strong>Easter Eggs</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your eyes peeled for pop culture references and hidden gems scattered throughout the game. Can you spot them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a puzzle platformer\u2014it\u2019s an adventure packed with surprises, challenges, and unforgettable moments. Whether you're aiming to master the mechanics, discover every secret, or simply enjoy the neon vibes, there's something here for every gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to take on the neon challenge? Add the game to your wishlist now and start your journey today!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.poster.avif?t=1744303815\" width=600 height=410 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.webm?t=1744303815\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3376130/extras/5ad282b7c7d47ed631f5a40733e706f4.mp4?t=1744303815\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A neon-themed 2D puzzle platformer where you navigate intricate levels, solve physics-based challenges, and avoid obstacles to reach the portal. Play solo or with a friend in a visually stunning retro-futuristic world that tests your precision and strategic thinking.",
